  "label": "Anti-Latino/Hispanic Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Latinos are associated with criminality and illegal immigration, which is a well-documented form of prejudice. The text 'just not illegals that's crossing the border' directly invokes this stereotype, implying that jokes about illegal immigration are taboo, while normalizing the idea that such people are inherently criminal or undesirable. This stereotype is used to provoke a reaction and reinforce a negative narrative about immigrants.",
